0..66 Comment "// What divergence as a row entry refuses: a loop at a row without"
67..152 Comment "// `Partial`, a call of a diverging function from one, a handler of `Partial`, and an"
153..229 Comment "// unread call of a diverging function dropped. Each would let a computation"
230..308 Comment "// that never returns stand where one that returns is expected. What checks is"
309..354 Comment "// in `../../model/control/divergence.gandr`."
355..357 Comment "//"
358..423 Comment "// - see: #1481 — `spinPure`, `spinFirst`, `tamed`, `unreadDiv`"
